  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'YOUR TRUCK IS THE SKEE-BALL

    Nine launches each. Drive down the approach
    and up the actual curved EasyRoads ramp. Entry speed, angle and alignment create
    the flight; there is no launch button or automatic scoring trajectory. REVERSE
    brakes before reversing. Limited aftertouch nudges lateral/range flight; release
    forward/back after launch to arm range correction. It cannot hover or change
    vertical flight. The first target-board contact disables all aftertouch and propulsion.


    Enter
    the real open rings:10,20,30,40,50 or the two100-point corners. Your entire authoritative
    truck must pass through the same opening. A rim/outside hit, miss, approach fall
    or genuine bounded simulation failure is zero. Swept whole-body crossing prevents
    fast rear-chassis skips. One award per numbered delivery.


    Up to four simultaneous
    separate lanes, each progressing independently. Hot seat supports up to eight
    and rotates participants after each delivery. Tied leaders get one equal-opportunity
    extra launch each until resolved; everyone completes their nine before extras
    begin. Solo retains a personal best. Same NWH wheels, ramp, gravity, control
    limits and scoring apply to AI.


    Cab view defaults for humans. Fresh ACTION
    during approach/flight switches your cab/chase view without affecting the truck.
    Whole-pad right stick or the explicitly owned mouse looks in the cab; shared
    sticks retain fixed cameras. Recorded landing replays: LEFT/RIGHT changes angle,
    FORWARD/BACK chooses fast/slow, ACTION skips after a neutral release. AI replays
    are brief. Your replay never pauses another lane. Shared settings, pause/reconnect
    and rematches preserve normal ownership. Offline only.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
